# Data & model artifacts are intentionally COMMITTED for this demo project
# (small synthetic CSVs + small sklearn models) so the frontend/backend run
# immediately after `git clone` without rerunning the pipeline. If these
# grow large, move them to Git LFS or regenerate on deploy instead.
